                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kinde m’ing’olo lembang’ola ni Yehova Mungu peri, kud igal ku cule: kum Yehova Mungu peri bilwong’e i beng’i andha; man ebibedo iri ni dubo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento tek iceri kum ng’ololembe, ebibedo iri ni dubo ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keth cwinyi kum lembe m’uai i dhogi man itime; calu ing’olo lembe ni Yehova Mungu peri, girathiera ma ku berocwiny, m’ing’olo ku dhogi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.23"
            ]
          }
        }
